# a format 32 project, from before the arp's 1/4D (format 33: the speeds one further, 1/4D first): saved by that build,
# for the migration's test (tests/scenarios/migrate.xy). T2 an arp at 1/8 (3), a speed lock on step 5 at 1/4 (0) and
# one on step 9 at 1/64 (10, the fastest); T3 an arp at 1/4; the master filter's drums at 30 and mix resonance 90
# (format 32's MS_DFILT and MS_MRES; MS_DRES, now melodic, at 0).
# Run by a format 32 build (f03fa41): its loom_host tests/fixtures/make_v32.xy OUT
wait 300
bpm 117
param 2 player 1
param 2 p1 3
pat 2 1 16 1 50 0
notes 2 1 1 0.5 100 C3
lock 2 1 5 p1 0
lock 2 1 9 p1 10
param 3 player 1
param 3 p1 0
mst dfilt 30
mst mres 90
wait 40
projsave 1 v32_test
storesave tests/fixtures/store_v32.bin
